@startuml
title Publish and edit a class | FR-005 | BR-008/015–017
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor Teacher as T
participant SkillSwap as S
participant "Class records" as C
T -> S: Submit skills, description, schedule, price and seat count
S -> S: Check class details, verified student status\nand approval for every selected skill
alt Details invalid or Teacher not eligible
 S --> T: Refuse publication and explain the problem
else All checks pass
 S -> C: Save the published class
 S --> T: Published class details
end
opt Teacher edits an existing class
 T -> S: Submit changed class details
 S -> S: Check ownership, class status, future start\nand whether confirmed bookings prevent editing
 opt Selected skills change
  S -> S: Check approval for every resulting skill again
 end
 alt Editing is allowed
  S -> C: Save the changes
  S --> T: Updated class details
 else Editing is not allowed
  S --> T: Refuse the changes and explain why
 end
end
note over S,C: Approval changes reach class records in the background.\nCurrent publication checks beginner-level approval only.
@enduml
